omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I4sYH0u6PfwQ7kNvwG-HMZx&_nc_oc=Adr2psH6npAfwwrrQRzEM_5b8Mnt6qwGtUkBRWd90ANHsv1xUpqeUlJlVrh1VXT6BYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af91qY39XR9WCIrb90GJ_fmMHovLxkM75iDc0UgfsDPxjA&oe=6A32BBB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v1brd0JbJFkQ7kNvwFFqpmp&_nc_oc=AdoNbilk2iNq6hwXKnEh2syEA85YLk-UOXbDwg3pgmdgEWYd68try95voH273-IBZ80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_SQPit3TAgZFPuTfr82HiqKVtnmBSfx7Z-KhBpDpO3yA&oe=6A32BD16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CzGluVtyuoYQ7kNvwFA0kT4&_nc_oc=AdqGdRsJRaZ7bFmt7OHa14XmXwxkhMlzbUOXdkPxdJr8CpfQwDBuqWANBovOpONhrXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WUZl_mmhtY4BJ_Rp3dmYC753pPGf1HmXjDXBm8gx0BQ&oe=6A3299F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://